  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Pattern: Xを{果|は}たす.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{役割|やくわり}を{果|は}たす (to fulfill a role)\n・{約束|やくそく}を{果|は}たす (to keep a promise)\n・{責任|せきにん}を{果|は}たす (to fulfill responsibility)\n・{義務|ぎむ}を{果|は}たす (to carry out one's duty)\n・{目的|もくてき}を{果|は}たす (to achieve one's purpose)\n\nRELATED:\n・{果|は}たして (as expected; indeed)",
